# anima_art

Game art by Anima on our Forge: icons (flat / painted), portraits, UI elements — the pipeline in tools/anima and the lessons of the trials.

The full procedure is in [.claude/skills/anima_art/SKILL.md](mdc:.claude/skills/anima_art/SKILL.md).

Read that file when this rule triggers, then follow it.

**Quick reference:**

- `make_jobs.py` → `jobs/*.json`; `anima_gen.py` on the server (`--style painted` → `out_painted/`, `--recut`); `install.py` by `picks*.json` (`variant`, `redo`, `reseed`, `overlay`)
- `--style painted` draws by BG3-like families (`FAMILY`, docs/design/ux/bg3-icons.md): items an object cut out, spells a bright glowing sign on a rounded stone tile cut out of black, features the same sign on a plate of bright steel, acts hands or a thing in a few dark ink strokes on that steel, traits the sign on bronze, conditions a flat emblem in a thin gold ring, ui thin gold outlines on black (cut by brightness, one gold), groups objects, marks flat; a tile is cut by its shape, an object at home by matte.py (BiRefNet on the GPU), never by colour
- `--backend openrouter` draws the same prompt by FLUX 3 Klein (no negative, the seed not kept) into `out_painted_flux/`, picked into `picks_flux.json`; the acts are drawn by it (2026-11-12)
- `pick.py` is one page for every kind drawn (`http://127.0.0.1:8791/`, a button per kind, `#acts`); each kind writes into its folder's picks file (`SETS`)
- A systematic miss (a tag like «wolf», «no humans», «small») is fixed in `subjects.json` / `portraits.json`, a random one by `reseed`; review at the game's size
- ControlNet LLLite breaks Forge on its second call: unload the checkpoint after each frame, never run it beside another job; never use another game's art as a reference
- Interface: `ui/guides.py` → `ui/paint.py` (a style in `STYLE`) → `ui/mock.py`, `ui/preview.py` (the game's screens of the picks, «Превью» in `pick.py`); the author's pick is the `lines` style (2026-11-12): a dark panel in two thin gold lines, ornaments only in the corners, crest / divider / ring laid whole on black
